   "line": [
    "Bxb6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Collect the loosened knight with the bishop on b6. The point of the earlier d5 is realised — a concrete gain, converting the central pressure into material.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Follow a well-timed break to its concrete payoff — the win of the undersupported piece.",
   "plans": "Consolidate the extra material and press the centre."
